ged\">Forged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Stone\">$18/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">$18/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">$20/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.0.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><blockquote>\n<p> <i>\"A beautiful rock, sometimes with ore! Can be refined or sold.\"</i>\n</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Darkslate</b> is one of the various nodes that spawn around Oaklands. \n</p><p>This stone is one of the darker variants found within Oaklands. It is a dark stone-grey colour. It can be sold or used to build by filling <a href=\"/wiki/Blueprint\" title=\"Blueprint\">blueprints</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Schematics\" title=\"Schematics\">schematics</a>.\n</p><p>They spawn on both islands (<a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater</a>) and on the smaller adjacent islands off the coast of them.  Most commonly, they can be found within the Farlands. Like the other common stones, these nodes come in large variety of sizes. These nodes mostly spawn in a medium range of sizes.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<p>To obtain Darkslate, players must mine it with a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Tools\" title=\"Category:Tools\">pickaxe</a>. Once a node is located, hit the rocks with a pickaxe until they break off of the node. Players can then pick up and transport the rock to sell it or to store at their base.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ore_Spawning\">Ore Spawning</span></h2>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_chart_below_displays_all_possible_ores_that_spawn_within_this_node.\">The chart below displays all possible ores that spawn within this node.</span></h5>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/80/Tin.png/revision/latest?cb=20230117004440\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Tin\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"104\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Tin.png\" data-image-key=\"Tin.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/80/Tin.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20230117004440\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Tin\" title=\"Tin\">Tin</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figur