4/Adurite.png/revision/latest?cb=20240324113339\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Adurite\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Adurite.png\" data-image-key=\"Adurite.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a4/Adurite.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20240324113339\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Adurite\" title=\"Adurite\">Adurite</a></td>\n<td>1/175 chance spawn\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Its raw variant uses a pre-2022 Slate Roblox material.</li>\n<li>Its refined variant uses a pre-2022 Concrete Roblox material.</li>\n<li>Its forged variant uses a pre-2022 Cobblestone material.\n<ul><li>All versions use the dark grey color.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Stone_Nav\" title=\"Template:Stone Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Stone_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Stone_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a hre